From 30219b1211ce23c8b1c6cc8384b459c9c9710c69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rodrigo <32554920+RodriLoy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:28:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher: run-time language picker (English default),
 Spanish, wider coverage

- launcher_i18n: languages chosen at run time and saved to config.ini
  [General] LauncherLanguage; English stays the default. Built-in Spanish
  and Italian; games register more strings/languages with
  launcher_i18n_register(). 'Label##id' keeps its id; 'Text||context' keys
  translate only through an explicit entry.
- Header combo to switch language live.
- Literal ImGui labels, ROM status, binding rows/chips and the install
  button now go through ui_text().

---
