+ * English is the source language: every string in the UI is written in
+ * English and looked up here at draw time. The language is chosen at run
+ * time (the language button in the launcher header) and remembered in the
+ * host's config.ini as [General] LauncherLanguage. English is the default
+ * unless the build sets RECOMP_UI_LANGUAGE or the player picks another one.
+ *
+ * Games add their own strings (mod feature names, in-game menus) with
+ * launcher_i18n_register(); the same lookup then serves them. */
+
